{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1248,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de7671912f9ef8605df28b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……没想到竟然会是这种状态，\r\n实在情何以堪。\r\n但……我还是要紧咬着胜利不放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24933477f3b0e55195407872fe483eb2167595bc24e6a1d2686dd1ebc81b39ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32a9ee9af28514772b063563",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……状态差到连眼神都无法集中。\r\n但我还是要保持冷静才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a60b42331c91156b2a78f77a9d0398c701439922d6b649b399d28ce594ada7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0353f5384813ac698a5deb51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "了解了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aa172dae78209df2f14e91329ffda222530cabbd0fff916fc7abb9ccad4ffc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877e936777d6b633e99a62b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4897f52c43d9b474d83e48ba7ec90f706f33789d73c0b336301f7717056677f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04e89866745c92fab1e362d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，知道了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58c6339e12dc8519d5db434cf6c39947f317c74bfed19b8e9d6a8551f629f3a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dad4d5b36f9600fb447fbf08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "智谋才是武器，是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a36e6f60ac4ea98dbb416f47dc9247a262f118280372e9aeb959c401d9b79fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69df4de71ddc5cd5fd222b43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "533af1ec55aaabd2fb64979f1b375b53b2aa3d91c5132bfaaf1eceef39f399ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bdd3e1992be36c37f2ffe1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太难堪了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "000c49426fab534249ce02f305055455f697a8df1ed2723ceef9d5c350c7428e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62ff174f7f5e7901f69624f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上场了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7ae06627c688f0d088a0dec073c588f1374c7334300267b4d6feffee9fbeb23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d6a143e15db746c9be93f5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别那么激动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c63ed1e46a306a6ccb27b16637e6e1a544e5b7b66f4898e61d7c16403aa08cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a4cc4e48ec1cf566c2ad3ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有劳了……今后也麻烦你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a4516e03249e5b1d4478ce6f975161afc8afa6a256d51a876960a0d2cc8623",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aae51667a42cb1b20acd7d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后也要继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7968a6e2d5288ca1ff827df7f351fb7c19560c22fdf96c20d000dc303d3224",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f066cdc7883ef5f674b05a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始锻炼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6dc10fa3aa19f142e943d231e41fd8e0277977dcbe2514d658a4202973cbd9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e4b49d88c21c70d5efe0beb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打起精神迎战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a0e7ce630ad5f0dd10873407fba8c959835a6b581c2fa7f9932273c5313ec8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2de09399611fdd4fcea5b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们要一起拿下胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8653cf33894e5c13d166480fd5675fb93d7f7d1712b1cf3efd573bdbfb4af7ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd152ee263571968a3baad92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后也要继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7968a6e2d5288ca1ff827df7f351fb7c19560c22fdf96c20d000dc303d3224",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:088fe13f3d18f8f33776b39d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！\r\n让后进们看看我的背影……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf743c59cba5a14f6293c077fc5fdda6ebeb31b6ebe963b8986c786bba72a2db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8c81be0b438edf91cdb33f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……这怎么行，\r\n我竟然受到会场气氛的影响，\r\n情绪跟着高涨了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbc1b8f392f2e70627b8520775aebc9666d7b82e2b8172e1cd5fa51e3c44cbf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34eb45c7f273af4ab4fa9a78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后也要继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7968a6e2d5288ca1ff827df7f351fb7c19560c22fdf96c20d000dc303d3224",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e62160821bfd211aae68299b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいだろう…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18574edaec7b2d99a3bbadd12076945a414455b3870b9e9b9c6794854e4405f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1e190bdc968bb5c205811b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只差一步……下次我一定会拿下胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37165a2b603a439c97376c2fcd739ae6b91cbff841937ccb8af4a9eed0674832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33ea9093a32679de15e13f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把这次的结果当作经验活用吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e066b503ff749a5ce17a70e05df7322499bc8039826a9f9f661f0f0de4e5f374",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ebc51d88c3d37d755b99da7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的结果……我不满意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d14b990a259c8d2fb8b01b1dddb3c43c419305422122377d1486560ba1f24aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f1270367b471cb188ae1a50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这惨状是怎么回事……可恶……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbe41794e7ed86b791e7dcb9cbc3afc741e694b7d87028d1ec21564fe783a0f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cca5722897bda568d6a508b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有听见这些欢呼声吗……这个……就是理想啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0352c8b7d8d7689c6977d1e9348eef7d13815f17ff8fe08c045c9e9d63e9b99a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a91e16fce8f9f496fe3bbd60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们……又离理想更近了一步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c02415bb73e17f08d0e3da0ecf1368828a338f79083afdf7216faea2d81c565a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaa3150017969b371953b868",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "响起吧，胜利的钟声……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78694f421ddff11159122a41f8b5abe4dfbc8d1a45371b5832ce2c435651473",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b109b75900768bfc9ef146",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们……又离理想更近了一步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c02415bb73e17f08d0e3da0ecf1368828a338f79083afdf7216faea2d81c565a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bd2ae630c579831ef12222f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "167c476ae4e50740d222867d26ce1988fafb946c30ad3f608beb919ca0d564f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1962c94faf8912c3279ae7c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是……「女帝」的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb9e646cc3c4988459cb5cfbacf42aadec553a987186f3f4435a5bc077b1bdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e36aca524235d7ba6875a8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "化朗塔点灯啊……\r\n真希望母亲也能欣赏到。\r\n……来查查最佳的观赏地点吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65148cb980ac0652217ab03b2f90623ff56ca1daed19568039b6b4295d0932bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80685618cfb73234bdae337b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论契机为何，\r\n要做就要尽力做到最好。\r\n我一定会通过考验，获得决胜服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ca631d421771bd2c419e1b1b68bcb40081388179a2eef0bde00438ee1dccc8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25056cd5ba134401e70c2c8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然过程中有些意外，\r\n但克服逆境反败为胜，\r\n才有资格被称之为「女帝」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d5b1dc7235f6c72db97356d0f28d0601bd43eb64a5470e279566fe3c31d6b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acd2f90d2b2e033d3be53b3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本学园的学生都如此率直而耀眼……\r\n会长，我们一定──\r\n要一起实现我们的理想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad81066d00abed20cd987b6ade464cfffb07e056b266cc070ba8ce7b42c3136",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76304de52cf2b932ee62ae55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是……「女帝」的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb9e646cc3c4988459cb5cfbacf42aadec553a987186f3f4435a5bc077b1bdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb45756916ef39e73ad55bcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我的决胜服，\r\n也代表Beauty小姐眼中的我吗？\r\n呵……不错嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "256919b5061f72ee3badc7227fc4aed8547f9d0286f61a5b3130f34b7fed7dfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e7a65b2badc3844aff229e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有看过活动任务了吗？\r\n先从做得来的任务开始进行吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7224537f1f1f7453bc5a9c9e2a1c728a7607cb2be617e237cffd0d1abe39df3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fc8a18fa5c2bc6ebf0b3322",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动在没有重大意外的\r\n情况下平安落幕了──\r\n你也做得很好嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b230053e8d1d247cdb3f004b2c4648eb7103b0ab54a6502b683461f724fdc64f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d9daab5a681d822c93c6084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动就到此结束了。\r\n……美丽安心泽，\r\n还真是个特别的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0396990b4b76203415e04f17813e949602d377c68f6ec8824bab189d96ed47cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced5c23b1d4d6edbdc705b60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵，太天真了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2dc4cdae952ea67d9db83aedfa72bbd9faa4782fe4541bf20de961cf6fba6a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74fc4c772fc8d6bdb01d75fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我发誓……必会取得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1140cb4064cb37052452833c89b8560ff894154e41bf6164ed1fa2fc4ab35503",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5e54c6d5220acb9735ccf16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然会长也很开心……但没想到\r\n她会说「明天要三人一起拍照」。\r\n……这下得先抓住白仁才行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23258cb0a29cf8546b11eb9bb78c9a84fb5800bd82f387059f91c48a8e626bc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:091b38ae920b2b3449227af6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……光明璀璨的未来……\r\n我一定会让你看见的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba55cbbf6e6806f1560a5b163e0e9e924b0eb5ad6f4568a5ba9cf753e5b95e14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ea418833d4136399f09519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "室友都是些奇特的人……\r\n或说可疑人物。话说回来，\r\n不晓得铃鹿能不能顺利适应呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb7a10f572abd93444de675d959fbedeb078075bd912386d20cebec6566ac8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd2d8546f10415087570ff83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个夏天……我一直在讲一些……\r\n不像是我会说的话。\r\n……不，这也是回忆吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b72d9b07da953a08713d222a8695b2da35584c2495ac9b2381980527d0431c72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "400057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beee3c4bb7e84f7f0dd20cde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要走啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2def9cbddf426f2e510518e2aa76acba4dcf13fc1e2188693a59eff56340783c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
